#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:199
msgid "Run on all three nodes:"
msgstr "Ejecute en los tres nodos:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:201
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:226
#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:277
msgid "morpheus-ctl reconfigure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:205
msgid ""
"Nodes can be reconfigured in any order. The cluster will form once all "
"nodes are up and can reach each other."
msgstr "Los nodos pueden reconfigurarse en cualquier orden. El clúster se formará una vez que todos los nodos estén activos y puedan alcanzarse entre sí."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:208
msgid "With Secure Mode"
msgstr "Con modo seguro"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:210
msgid ""
"Secure mode enables TLS on both the HTTP and transport layers. Each node "
"generates its own node certificate, but all nodes must share the **same "
"root CA**."
msgstr "El modo seguro habilita TLS en las capas HTTP y de transporte. Cada nodo genera su propio certificado de nodo, pero todos los nodos deben compartir la **misma CA raíz**."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:212
msgid "**Step 1 — Configure and reconfigure Node 1 first**"
msgstr "**Paso 1 — Configurar y reconfigurar el Nodo 1 primero**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:214
msgid "Node 1 — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"
msgstr "Nodo 1 — ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb``:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:216
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'10.0.0.1' => 9200, '10.0.0.2' => 9200, "
"'10.0.0.3' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['node_name'] = 'morpheus-1'\n"
"opensearch['host'] = '0.0.0.0'\n"
"opensearch['publish_ip'] = '10.0.0.1'\n"
"opensearch['secure_mode'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:224
msgid "Run reconfigure on Node 1:"
msgstr "Ejecute reconfigure en el Nodo 1:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:230
msgid "This generates the root CA and node certificate at:"
msgstr "Esto genera la CA raíz y el certificado de nodo en:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:232
msgid "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca.pem``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:233
msgid "``/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca-key.pem``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:235
msgid "**Step 2 — Copy the root CA to Nodes 2 and 3**"
msgstr "**Paso 2 — Copiar la CA raíz a los Nodos 2 y 3**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:237
msgid ""
"Copy both CA files from Node 1 to the same path on Nodes 2 and 3 "
"**before** running reconfigure on them:"
msgstr "Copie ambos archivos de CA del Nodo 1 a la misma ruta en los Nodos 2 y 3 **antes** de ejecutar reconfigure en ellos:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:239
msgid ""
"# From Node 1:\n"
"scp /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca.pem     "
"node2:/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/\n"
"scp /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/root-ca-key.pem  "
"node2:/opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config/"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:245
msgid "Set ownership on Nodes 2 and 3:"
msgstr "Establezca la propiedad en los Nodos 2 y 3:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:247
msgid ""
"chown morpheus-es:morpheus-es /opt/morpheus/embedded/opensearch-*/config"
"/root-ca*.pem"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:251
msgid "**Step 3 — Configure and reconfigure Nodes 2 and 3**"
msgstr "**Paso 3 — Configurar y reconfigurar los Nodos 2 y 3**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:253
msgid ""
"Set the same configuration with ``secure_mode = true`` on each node (with"
" the appropriate ``node_name`` and ``publish_ip``), then run ``morpheus-"
"ctl reconfigure``. Each node will skip CA generation (the files already "
"exist) and generate its own node certificate signed by the shared CA."
msgstr "Establezca la misma configuración con ``secure_mode = true`` en cada nodo (con el ``node_name`` y ``publish_ip`` correspondientes), luego ejecute ``morpheus-ctl reconfigure``. Cada nodo omitirá la generación de CA (los archivos ya existen) y generará su propio certificado de nodo firmado por la CA compartida."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:256
msgid "External Cluster"
msgstr "Clúster externo"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:258
msgid ""
"When using an externally managed OpenSearch (or Elasticsearch) cluster, "
"disable the embedded service and point |morpheus| at the external hosts."
msgstr "Al utilizar un clúster OpenSearch (o Elasticsearch) administrado externamente, deshabilite el servicio incorporado y apunte |morpheus| a los hosts externos."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:260
msgid ""
"Add the following to ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` on each |morpheus| "
"appliance node:"
msgstr "Agregue lo siguiente a ``/etc/morpheus/morpheus.rb`` en cada nodo del dispositivo |morpheus|:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:262
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"opensearch['enable'] = false\n"
"opensearch['es_hosts'] = {'os-node1.example.com' => 9200, 'os-"
"node2.example.com' => 9200, 'os-node3.example.com' => 9200}\n"
"opensearch['auth_user'] = 'morpheus'\n"
"opensearch['auth_password'] = 'the-external-cluster-password'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:269
msgid "If the external cluster uses TLS:"
msgstr "Si el clúster externo utiliza TLS:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:271
msgid "opensearch['use_tls'] = true"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:275
msgid "Then reconfigure:"
msgstr "Luego reconfigure:"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:281
msgid ""
"The embedded OpenSearch service will not be started. |morpheus| connects "
"directly to the external cluster."
msgstr "El servicio OpenSearch incorporado no se iniciará. |morpheus| se conecta directamente al clúster externo."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:283
msgid "**Notes for external clusters:**"
msgstr "**Notas para clústeres externos:**"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:285
msgid ""
"``auth_user`` and ``auth_password`` are sent to the external cluster for "
"authentication. These must match a user configured on the external "
"cluster."
msgstr "``auth_user`` y ``auth_password`` se envían al clúster externo para autenticación. Deben coincidir con un usuario configurado en el clúster externo."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:286
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``auth_password`` supports the ``ENC{...}`` encrypted format (see "
"Encrypting Passwords above)."
msgstr "``auth_password`` admite el formato cifrado ``ENC{...}`` (consulte Cifrado de contraseñas más arriba)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:287
msgid ""
"Do **not** set ``secure_mode`` — that setting controls the embedded "
"service's certificate generation. For external TLS clusters, use "
"``use_tls`` instead."
msgstr "No establezca ``secure_mode`` — esa configuración controla la generación de certificados del servicio incorporado. Para clústeres TLS externos, utilice ``use_tls`` en su lugar."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:288
msgid ""
"``replica_count`` can be adjusted to match the external cluster's "
"topology (default ``1``)."
msgstr "``replica_count`` puede ajustarse para coincidir con la topología del clúster externo (predeterminado ``1``)."

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/opensearch.rst:289
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports both OpenSearch and Elasticsearch as the external "
"cluster — no migration is required on the external side."
msgstr "|morpheus| admite OpenSearch y Elasticsearch como clúster externo — no se requiere migración en el lado externo."

